                    "value": "<p>The boggard guard unleashes a terrifying croak. Any non-boggard within 30 feet becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} unless they succeed at a @Check[will|dc:17] save. Those who critically succeed are temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>"
