                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>If the boggard guard hits a creature with their tongue, that creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] by the boggard. Unlike with a normal Grab, the creature is not @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized], but it can't move beyond the reach of the boggard's tongue. A creature can sever the tongue by hitting AC 13 and dealing at least @Damage[2[slashing]] damage. Though this doesn't deal any damage to the boggard, it prevents them from using their tongue Strike again in this adventure.</p>"
                },
